  "protocolNote": "Classic LG 28-bit AC IR (NEC-like pulse-distance), 38 kHz. Timings/frames from open-source IRremoteESP8266 (ir_LG) and Nosdave/ha-lg-ac-infrared codec \u2014 GE6711AR2853M / 6711A20*** family (e.g. remote 6711A20073Z). Address/signature 0x88. Power On = Cool 24\u00b0C Fan Auto state frame; Power Off = 0x88C0051; Swing = vertical auto-swing 0x8813149. LG2 remotes (AKB74955603 / AKB73757604 / AKB75215403) use a different header (3200/9900) and may need a separate pack. Not all wall/split models accept every swing/fan nibble.",
